      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Tucked away in a quiet cul-de-sac just off Colla Road, this distinctive semi-detached home enjoys a peaceful setting within easy walking distance of the seaside village of Schull and all its amenities.\r\nWith its striking timber-clad exterior, quirky design features and individual décor, the property is full of character and offers bright, open-plan living spaces that create a warm and welcoming atmosphere.\r\nA particular feature of the home is the first-floor balconies to the rear, providing a lovely spot to relax while overlooking the generous enclosed garden and decking area, perfect for entertaining or simply enjoying the peaceful surroundings.\r\nAdding to its versatility is a self-contained studio at ground floor level, offering potential as a home office, studio or guest accommodation.\r\nThis home enjoys an excellent location within walking distance of Schull's harbour, independent shops, cafés, restaurants and a host of local amenities.\r\n\r\nFeatures: \r\nPrivate parking.  \r\nFront and rear garden. \r\nMain house heated with Air source heat pump & stove. \r\nSolid wood flooring throughout. \r\nStudio apartment heated with stove & electric heating.  \r\nLarge detached utility room: (3.4m x 4.3m). \r\nProperty located 150m off the Colla Road. \r\n\r\nStudio apartment: \r\nOpen plan kitchen / dining / living: (6.5m x 3m) \r\nLoft bed \r\nStorage area \r\nShower room: shower, wc, whb \r\nPrivate access and deck area\r\n\r\nMain house layout: \r\nEntrance hall: (1.8m x 2m)\r\nGuest wc: (1.5m x 1.3m) wc, whb \r\nOpen plan kitchen / dining / living: (7m x 8.5m)  opening onto rear deck & gardens. \r\nBedroom 1: (2m x 3m) ensuite: (1.6m x 1.5m) shower, wc, whb. \r\n\r\n1st floor: \r\nBedroom 2: (8.6m x 5.4m) Large South facing balcony with sea views. \r\nensuite: (2.3m x 2.4m) bath, shower, wc, whb \r\n\r\n2nd floor: \r\nStorage rooms with floor area: (7.8m x 3.8m) Floor to ceiling height: (1.8m)"
